<td style="width: 0.25in"/><td style="width: 0.25in">&#9679;</td><td>uncertainties regarding the Company&#8217;s focus, strategic plans and other management actions;</td></tr></table>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0 0pt 0.5in; background-color: white">&#160;</p>

